<title>USA: Hartford Life files debt issue details.</title>
<headline>Hartford Life files debt issue details.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hartford Life Inc filed a registration statement to offer up to $1 billion in debt securities, preferred stock and depositary shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the company said proceeds will go to refinance debt, including outstanding commercial paper and other third-party debt.</p>
<p>Proceeds will also go toward working capital, capital expenditures, investments in or loans to subsidiaries, and for other general corporate purposes.</p>
</text>
